           The legacy of Paul Kalanithi
          </div>
          <div class="cmp-teaser__description">
           <p>His gift to the world was a poignant telling of a promising young life taken by cancer a decade ago. Still today, the Stanford Medicine neurosurgeon's wife Lucy receives notes of gratitude weekly.</p>
